  },
  {
    q: 'Why did Pfizer stop developing PF-07258669?',
    a: 'Pfizer terminated the Phase 1 trial after only a handful of participants, stating that it was "prematurely discontinued due to a business decision" and that the decision was "not related to a safety concern." In other words the halt reflected portfolio priorities, not a failure of the molecule or the target - a reminder that drug programs stop for reasons that have nothing to do with the science.',
